                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Sheesh, the game was revoked from a bundle purchased a few years back, plus the price of the game was recently increased nearly seven-fold. The steam forum is an ugly cesspool with the dev’s responses to the complaints of the customers., being very hostile and deleting threads.\n\nTalking about the gameplay itself, the aesthetics is quite nice with the space theme and funky music, however, the gameplay is kind of meh being a generic 2D runner which can be a bit clunky while playing.\n\nAll in all, the price of the game increasing greatly and being revoked from an old purchase leaves a rather sour taste and a bad light to the experience.",
